From: remail@tamsun.tamu.edu
Subject: Judgement Proofing

Mark DeSilets asks for more info on judgement proofing (aka extortion
proofing).  Unfortuneately, there is no way to be completely judgement 
proof.  However, here are some broad goals to strive for:

* Mobility: minimize economic and social depence on a physical
community.  Move dependence to free virtual communities untraceable to 
your physical location.

* Get rid of attachable property.  Most property should either be mobile 
and concealable (eg diamonds), in the name of another entity with better
political connections or protection, or offshore.  Don't tie up your 
life savings in vulnerable property like an expensive house; lease instead.  
(Political extortion can take many forms -- don't invest in real estate 
without local political connections.  For example my last landlord, 
an absentee foreign citizen, got screwed to the tune of several
$million by the local zoning board).

* "Poison pills" that render attachable property worthless upon 
confiscation, or trigger harm to the confiscator in some way.
These can take a wide variety of physical or legal 
forms depending on the property in question. 

* Buy insurance against future extortion or judgements.  I've
outlined a business scenario for this might work; I don't know to
what extent such financial services exist now.  The insurance company 
would advise and require judgement proofing steps and have a 
significant deductable to minimize damage and moral hazard.

* Avoid future blackmail by minimizing potentially harmful information 
about your personal habits going into the system.  Use cash and other
private means of payment.  Amazing how many people rent X-rated
videos with their credit card, let their bank have their personal
budget, etc.  Of course we all take risks posting to the net
like this; if necessary use an anon remailer.  (Like this message.
You can probably guess who I am, but please don't for the record.  
The remailer provides plausible deniability and eliminates grep
searches on my True Name hitting this post in case of future anti-anarchist 
blackmail/blacklisting.  In this case anon remailing also serves as a 
role model for others who want to post on "how to drive 56" topics).

* Take steps to change you and your family's physical jurisdiction,
and even your "True Name" identity if necessary. (Cf. _How to
Disappear Completely and Never Be Found_, avaible from Loompanics
or some survivalist mail-order places).

* Cultivate the loyalty of close friends and relatives, and keep
damaging information away from potentially disloyal ones.  Most IRS 
turns-ins are by disgruntled spouses.

There are probably a bunch of things I have missed here; I'm still
learning myself.  At this point being judgement proof is out of reach 
for most of us, but as crypto-anarchy matures, it will become both easier
and more necessary.  Like other aspects of Realpolitik it relies
much more on our taking the initiative to restructure our own
part of the world than on futile attempts to get "society" to do it 
for us.



